Package: com.pulloverpro.ios26
Name: PullOver Pro (iOS 26)
Version: 3.0.0~beta3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Pin any app to a small handle on the side of the screen and pull it over whatever you're doing. Rootless port of c1d3r's PullOver Pro (GPL-3.0), updated for iOS 15-27 and Dopamine 3 / ElleKit on iOS 26.
Maintainer: PullOver Pro iOS 26 port
Author: c1d3r (original), Jond-ie (rootless port), iOS 26 fixes by the PullOver Pro iOS 26 port
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 28.0)
Recommends: com.opa334.altlist, preferenceloader
Conflicts: xyz.cypwn.pulloverpro, com.c1d3r.PullOverPro, com.c1d3r.pulloverpro, com.c1d3r.PullOverProPreferences, com.johndie.pulloverpro-rootless
